# Jobs of the azureuser crontab on the VM that belong to the Parquet API. The live crontab also holds
# the scrape service restart (04:00) and prune_logs.sh (Mondays 09:00); add or change lines with
# `crontab -e`, do not install this file wholesale. run_with_record.sh (~/bin) writes a run record to
# ~/logs/runs/<job>_<ts>.json and the full output to ~/logs/<job>/run_<ts>.log.
#
# Nightly parquet export from Azure SQL, 03:00 UTC. Since the switch-over of 2026-11-10 the eleven stats
# tables are owned by the fold below; the export still writes them, to data_shadow/, for the safety-net
# comparison (about two hours). After that week replace --stats-dir data_shadow with --skip-stats (minutes).
0 3 * * * /home/azureuser/bin/run_with_record.sh db-export -- bash -c 'cd /opt/tfmstats-api && /opt/tfmstats-api/venv/bin/python /opt/tfmstats-api/export_db.py --stats-dir data_shadow'
# Live fold: apply the stats documents from blob storage to data/ up to the export's start, rebuild
# gamecards_by_card.parquet, then (safety-net week) compare the SQL export of the eleven with the fold.
# After the week drop the comparison and --until-export-start.
30 5 * * * /home/azureuser/bin/run_with_record.sh stats-fold -- bash -c 'cd /opt/tfmstats-api && /opt/tfmstats-api/venv/bin/python /opt/tfmstats-api/build_stats_parquet.py --by-card --until-export-start && /opt/tfmstats-api/venv/bin/python /opt/tfmstats-api/compare_stats_exports.py --a data_shadow --b data'
